---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Page from '~/components/Page.astro';
import Hero from '~/components/Hero.astro';
import SectionLabel from '~/components/SectionLabel.astro';
import Card from '~/user-components/Card.astro';
import { sortByRecent } from '~/lib/anime';
import { getLookups, toDetail } from '~/lib/api';

const all = sortByRecent(await getCollection('anime'));
const origin = new URL('/api/v1/', Astro.site ?? Astro.url).href;

const endpoints = [
  { path: 'anime.json', desc: 'Daftar seluruh anime (ringkas), diurutkan dari yang terbaru ditambahkan.' },
  { path: 'anime/{id}.json', desc: 'Detail satu anime: judul alternatif, genre, studio, relasi, episode, sinopsis, dan ID eksternal.' },
  { path: 'genres.json', desc: 'Daftar genre beserta jumlah anime.' },
  { path: 'studios.json', desc: 'Daftar studio beserta jumlah anime.' },
  { path: 'stats.json', desc: 'Ringkasan katalog: total, jumlah per status dan tipe, total episode.' },
];

const fetchExample = `const res = await fetch('${origin}anime.json');
const { data } = await res.json();

// Anime yang sedang tayang
console.log(data.filter((a) => a.status === 'Ongoing'));`;

let sample = '';
if (all.length) {
  const detail = toDetail(all[0], await getLookups());
  sample = JSON.stringify(
    { data: { ...detail, episodes: detail.episodes.slice(0, 2) } },
    null,
    2
  );
}
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dokumentasi API"
  description="API publik QimochiDB: endpoint JSON untuk katalog anime, genre, studio, dan statistik."
>
  <Page>
    <Hero
      title="API publik"
      description="Baca saja (GET), format JSON, tanpa API key, dan CORS terbuka untuk semua domain."
    />

    <section class="block">
      <SectionLabel as="h2">Endpoint</SectionLabel>
      <p class="muted">Base URL: <code>{origin}</code></p>
      <ul class="endpoints">
        {
          endpoints.map((e) => (
            <li>
              <Card variant="outline" padding="md">
                <code class="path">GET {e.path}</code>
                <p>{e.desc}</p>
              </Card>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <SectionLabel as="h2">Contoh pemakaian</SectionLabel>
      <div class="markdown"><pre><code>{fetchExample}</code></pre></div>
    </section>

    {
      sample && (
        <section class="block">
          <SectionLabel as="h2">Contoh respons</SectionLabel>
          <p class="muted">Dari <code>anime/{all[0].id}.json</code>. Daftar episode dipotong jadi dua.</p>
          <div class="markdown"><pre><code>{sample}</code></pre></div>
        </section>
      )
    }

    <section class="block">
      <SectionLabel as="h2">Catatan</SectionLabel>
      <div class="markdown markdown--prose">
        <ul>
          <li>Data dibuat statis saat build, jadi cepat dan di-cache CDN. Perubahan terlihat setelah deploy ulang.</li>
          <li>Pencarian dan filter dilakukan di sisi klien dari <code>anime.json</code>.</li>
          <li>Nama field memakai snake_case. Field yang kosong bernilai <code>null</code>.</li>
          <li>Versi ada di path (<code>/v1/</code>). Bentuk respons masih bisa berubah selama tahap pengembangan.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Page>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .block { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-4); }
  .muted { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--fs-sm); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .endpoints { display: grid; gap: var(--s-3); margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .path { color: var(--accent-hover); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .endpoints p { margin-top: var(--s-1); color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .markdown :global(pre) { margin: 0; }
</style>
